  "notes": "Round6 scallop: ribbed fossil valves and violet mineral cleft. Complete native PixelLab pose edit, no scaling. Original anchor, support rows, frame layout/timing and held-object mask retained. Style v2 Glasswater beetle: slate shell and legs, pale iris crystal crest and eyes. Approved silhouettes and all pose durations are preserved, including the braced rear windup. Matte shell uses Glasswater rock/wall ramps; crest uses crystal_violet, with #e2d8e9 from fx.prism only at charge tips and eye flares. Cyan is reserved for Glint. Crystal faces and eyes retain their emissive roles; the shell, roots and legs stay matte. Feet stay on the anchor row; _right is mirrored for left."
